          <span class="lbl">Customer:</span> Acme Traders Pvt Ltd<br>
          <span class="lbl">Address:</span> Industrial Estate, Aluva<br>
          <span class="lbl">Phone:</span> 9123456780<br>
          <span class="lbl">GSTIN:</span> 32AAACA1111A1Z1<br>
          <span class="lbl">State:</span> Kerala (32)<br>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid #333; font-size: 11px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: space-between;">
      
      <div>
